models/*.onnx.data

# ...except the exported MotionNet graph, which SAT-ML §10.5 sizes at ~6k
# parameters / 24 KB. A checkpoint is training state and belongs nowhere near
# git; an exported graph that small is the difference between a feature that
# works on a fresh clone and one that only ever worked on the machine that
# trained it. Committing it is what lets CI's parity test and a live demo use
# the real network instead of silently taking the INV-7 fallback.
!models/motionnet_v1.onnx


__pycache__/

